<title>POLAND: KETY OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KETY OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.54 vs   1.97</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.36 vs   3.40</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.90 vs   3.67</p>
<p> Sales		   36.29 vs  33.26</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    25.17 vs  22.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	42.89 vs  34.96</p>
<p> Operating profit    36.46 vs  37.20</p>
<p> Sales		  322.76 vs 316.40</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish aluminium plant is Zaklady Metali</p>
<p>Lekkich Kety SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
